<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>In the frozen birthplace of nuclear fire, a Group 935 research base hides sinister secrets. Awaken the steel colossus, ignite the flame of vengeance, and free the giant Shadowsmith from the Warden's icy grip!</strong></em></p>
