<h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1>
<p>This is a walkthrough of the key features of the map, such as Pack-a-Punch, Wonder Weapons, etc.</p>
<div class="glass-card glass-gold"><h2 id="wiki_jotunn_star"><label class="g-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="g-cb" checked><span class="g-title">Jotunn Star<span class="g-tag">⭐ Wonder Weapon</span></span><span class="g-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></h2>
<ol>
<li id="guide-step-map-get-3-items">Get 3 items:

<ol>
<li id="guide-step-map-chilly-chunks-back-of-a-truck-next-to-deadshot-daiquiri-in-storm-bridg"><strong>Chilly Chunks</strong> - Back of a truck next to Deadshot Daiquiri in Storm Bridge. <ShowOnMap target="storm-bridge" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-map-lantern-place-the-chilly-chunks-on-the-table-in-the-center-of-skallen-"><strong>Lantern</strong> - Place the Chilly Chunks on the table in the center of Skallen Market. <strong>Starting with the 2nd Special Round</strong>, a named Zursa will spawn and will drop the Lantern after being killed. <ShowOnMap target="skallen-market" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-map-chain-links-interact-with-the-button-in-titan-crane-to-lower-a-wooden-"><strong>Chain Links</strong> - Interact with the button in Titan Crane to lower a wooden slab in front of the ship. Wall jump towards the bow of the ship and interact to get the chains.
 <ShowOnMap target="titan-crane" />
<ul>
<li><em>Note: the slab will only stay down for 30 seconds, but the button can be interacted as many times as needed.</em></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-reach-the-burial-grounds-and-interact-with-the-door-to-put-the-chain-l">Reach the Burial Grounds and interact with the door to put the chain links in, then hold interact to repair the door.  <ShowOnMap target="burial-grounds" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-map-place-the-lantern-on-the-shrine-in-burial-grounds-the-lantern-will-emi">Place the Lantern on the shrine in Burial Grounds. The lantern will emit lights on the wall, revealing constellations that rotate.</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-interact-with-the-constellation-symbols-on-the-wall-based-on-the-ones-">Interact with the constellation symbols on the wall, based on the ones on the shrine at Burial Grounds

<ul>
<li>The order is Left, Right, Back, Front when looking at the shrine from the stairs.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>If done correctly, the ghost of Astrid will appear above the shrine.</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-follow-astrid-she-will-move-toward-the-market-then-stop-kill-frost-zom">Follow Astrid. She will move toward the market, then stop. Kill Frost zombies that spawn to charge her energy bar until it is filled. <ShowOnMap target="skallen-market" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-map-once-astrid-is-near-the-lighthouse-repeat-the-energy-charging-process-">Once Astrid is near the lighthouse, repeat the energy charging process once more. Once done, floating platforms will appear. Climb the platforms and reach the lighthouse. <ShowOnMap target="lighthouse" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-map-continue-to-climb-the-lighthouse-with-the-stairs-and-the-outside-platf">Continue to climb the lighthouse with the stairs and the outside platforms.</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-interact-with-the-ladder-on-top-of-the-lighthouse-to-enter-the-top-cha">Interact with the ladder on top of the lighthouse to enter the top chamber, where the Jotunn Star will be available for pickup.</li>
</ol>
