<li id="guide-step-map-find-a-note-on-the-ground-in-either-dry-dock-in-the-room-with-the-inte">Find a note on the ground, in either Dry Dock in the room with the interactable button, or at Tyr's Foot near a corpse. The note will display a message that will determine which crate to open:
 <ShowOnMap target="areas-dry-dock--tyrs-foot" />
