</ul>
</li>
<li data-guide-step id="guide-step-map-find-the-corresponding-crate-in-one-of-the-possible-spawn-location-if-">Find the corresponding crate in one of the possible spawn location. If done correctly, the Flak Gun Round will drop from the crate. However, opening&nbsp;the wrong crate will trigger an effect for about 30 seconds, either repeated electrical shots, suffered from gas exposure, or experiencing hallucination similarly to Psych Grenades.

 <ShowOnMap target="locations-map-find-the-corresponding-crate-in-one-of-the-possible-spawn-loc" label="Show wundersignal locations on map" />
<ul>
<li id="guide-step-map-war-factory-in-a-corner-near-the-admin-room"><strong>War Factory</strong>, in a corner near the Admin room.</li>
