<div class="glass-card glass-orange"><h2 class="" id="wiki_atomkraft_core"><label class="g-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="g-cb" checked><span class="g-title">Atomkraft Core<span class="g-tag">☢️ Core</span></span><span class="g-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></h2>
<ol>
